    <a class="product-card-image" href="/products/2" aria-label="查看 玉带河书签">
        <img class="catalog-image" width="400" height="300" loading="lazy"
     src="/images/catalog-placeholder.svg" alt="玉带河书签" data-image-fallback="/images/catalog-placeholder.svg">
    </a>
    <div class="product-card-body">
        <p class="product-card-sku muted">CSU-LMK-BOOKMARK-01</p>
        <h3><a href="/products/2">玉带河书签</a></h3>
        <p class="product-card-summary muted">以潇湘校区玉带河为主题的纸质书签。</p>
        <div class="product-card-meta">
            <p class="product-price">¥8.00</p>
            <span class="stock-badge">库存 23</span>
        </div>
    </div>
