    <a class="product-card-image" href="/products/41" aria-label="查看 田径主题书签">
        <img class="catalog-image" width="400" height="300" loading="lazy"
     src="/images/catalog-placeholder.svg" alt="田径主题书签" data-image-fallback="/images/catalog-placeholder.svg">
    </a>
    <div class="product-card-body">
        <p class="product-card-sku muted">CSU-SPT-BOOKMARK-01</p>
        <h3><a href="/products/41">田径主题书签</a></h3>
        <p class="product-card-summary muted">校园文创课程样品。设计主题为田径主题书签。</p>
        <div class="product-card-meta">
            <p class="product-price">¥7.90</p>
            <span class="stock-badge">库存 18</span>
